{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Ahaz was the [Gm7]father of [Eb]Jarah
Jarah [F]was the fa[Gm7]ther [Eb]of Alemeth
[F]Azmaveth, [Bb]and Zimri [Eb]his child
Zimri [F]was the fa[Bb]ther of [Eb]Moza
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
From the [F]line of Saul they [Gm7]came
[Eb]Descendants in [F]the genealo[Gm7]gy
[Eb]Names recorded [F]in the [Bb]book
Jarah and [F/A]his sons are named
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Je[Gm7]hoad[Eb]dah is anoth[F]er name
In [Gm7]the [Eb]chapter [F]eight account
Same [Gm7]sons [Eb]listed in the [F]text
Ale[Bb]meth, Az[Eb]maveth, and Zim[F]ri
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
From the line [Bb]of Saul [Eb]they came
Descen[F]dants in the ge[Gm7]neal[Eb]ogy
Names re[F]corded in the [Gm7]book
[Eb]Jarah and his [F]sons are [Bb]named
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
